      "value": "Related feature request: [yt-dlp: Expose --extractor-args option for debugging video playback issues from the command line](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/yt-dlp-expose-extractor-args-option-for-debugging-video-playback-issues-from-the)",
